        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa OMWAMI Nyasayewo alasishia amahanga imbeliwo, ebweneyo ewa otsia okhwinjila nokhukabukula, nawe nokabukula nomenya mushialo shiako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kho wiyile kahala oleshe okhutiilwa mumubero okwokhubalondakhwo, olwa balaba nibamalile okhutibibwa imbeliwo; khandi mbu oleshe okhureebelesia akabanyasaye babwe, mbu Abamahanga kano bakhalabanilanga abanyasaye babwe barie? Siesi ekhole endio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
